{"id":"d5e50a47d180cbce","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-quantifier-chain.md","title":"df-quantifier-chain","display":"df-quantifier-chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-quantifier-chain","aliases":["16-df-quantifier-chain","16-quantifier-chain"],"display":"df-quantifier-chain","depends_on":["[[16-df-general-quantifier]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-quantifier-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-quantifier-chain</span><span>16-quantifier-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化，基范畴具有所选有限积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef7efb192e321ef0\" href=\"?note=ef7efb192e321ef0\" title=\"16-df-general-quantifier\">16-df-general-quantifier</a>。当这些性质成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_\\pi,\\forall_\\pi\">\\(\\exists_\\pi,\\forall_\\pi\\)</span> 取同一指定伴随见证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuantChain},\\mathsf{QuantChain}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuantChain},\\mathsf{QuantChain}\\)</span> 是下文定义的同一投影性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuantChain}_p(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuantChain}_p(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只断言在这条投影上存在量词链，不要求所有基箭头有量词。选择伴随见证后可写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\\dashv\\forall_\\pi\">\\(\\exists_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\\dashv\\forall_\\pi\\)</span>；比较与BC另行定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-general-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-general-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，基范畴具有所选有限积；$\\pi:I\\times J\\to I$。$\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}$ 采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]。当这些性质成立时，$\\exists_\\pi,\\forall_\\pi$ 取同一指定伴随见证。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi:I\\times J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_\\pi,\\forall_\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuantChain},\\mathsf{QuantChain}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(\\pi)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(\\pi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuantChain}_p(\\pi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\\dashv\\forall_\\pi","display":false}],"bytes":1084,"backlinks":[{"id":"3ac28e78a97bd5e3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带所选有限积及提升选择的纤维化，$\\pi:I\\times J\\to I$ 为投影；$\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)$ 采用 [[16-df-quantifier-chain]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-quantifier-chain|df-quantifier-chain]]"},{"id":"e4b96e479bac5350","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_\\pi=\\exists_\\pi$、$\\Pi_\\pi=\\forall_\\pi$ 和 $\\pi^*$ 取 [[16-df-quantifier-chain]] 中同一伴随链的函子。"}],"outgoing":["ef7efb192e321ef0"]}